==Event Information==
The Battle Cats is indulging its sweet tooth with a {{Color|#FF99CC|'''"Princess Punt Sweets"'''}} collab!<br>
{{Color|#E500FF|'''On from November 13, 2023 (11:00AM) to November 27, 2023 (10:59AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Princess Punt Sweets Capsules now available!'''}}<br>
Grab yourself exclusive Princess Punt Sweets characters in the event-limited Rare Capsules! Available characters include:

{{Color|#008000|'''【Uber Rare】'''}} [[Herme (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Herme'''}}]]<br>
Strong against Zombies! (Omnistrike)<br>
{{Color|#800080|'''【Uber Rare】'''}} [[Calette (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Calette'''}}]]<br>
100% chance to Weaken Angels, Zombies, and Aliens! (Area atk.)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【Uber Rare】'''}} [[HMS Princess (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''HMS Princess'''}}]]<br>
Earns extra Money after defeating foes (Area atk.)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''【Uber Rare】'''}} [[Crazed Princess Punt (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Crazed Princess Punt'''}}]]<br>
Might Knockback Metal enemies (Area atk.)<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''【Uber Rare】'''}} [[PPT48 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''PPT48'''}}]]<br>
Might Freeze Black enemies (Area atk.)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【Super Rare】'''}} [[Hina (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Hina'''}}]]<br>
100% chance of Wave Attack.<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''【Super Rare】'''}} [[Yurinchi (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Yurinchi'''}}]]<br>
Strong against Angels (Area atk.)<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''【Super Rare】'''}} [[Reaper (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Reaper'''}}]]<br>
Might Slow Black enemies (Area atk.)<br>
{{Color|#82318E|'''【Rare】'''}} [[Li'l Gau (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#82318E|'''Li'l Gau'''}}]]<br>
Resistant to damage from Black enemies. Low-cost unit with good defense vs. Black enemies.<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''【Rare】'''}} [[Cow Princess (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Cow Princess'''}}]]<br>
A cow on the hunt for a hot guy! Deals Massive damage to Black enemies.<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''【Rare】'''}} [[Swordsman (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Swordsman'''}}]]<br>
A man who is used to the trials of war.

※Please note that draws from the "Princess Punt Sweets" Rare Capsule set may provide regularly appearing rare Cat units. "Princess Punt Sweets" collab units will not be available from other scheduled Rare Capsule sets appearing during the collaboration.<br>
※If "Princess Punt Sweets" content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.<br>
※In order to unlock Talents, you must clear Into the Future Ch. 3.<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Sweet collab stages have been added!'''}}<br>
Challenge the princess with a sweet tooth! Do battle with characters from Princess Punt Sweets!<br>
During this event, visit the Legend Stages from the Battle Cats title menu and visit the Special Stages section to take on this challenge.

※If Princess Punt Sweets collab stages do not appear, please update to the latest version of the Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・New collab stages "Princess Punt" and "Alluring Princess" now available!'''}}<br>
Clear the stages "{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Princess Punt'''}}" and "{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Alluring Princess'''}}" to earn the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Special unit'''}} [[Cat Princess (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cat Princess'''}}]] and {{Color|#00FFFF|'''Super Rare unit'''}} [[Sleeping Beauty Punt (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00FFFF|'''Sleeping Princess Beauty'''}}]]<nowiki></nowiki>respectively!<br>
Clear tougher stages to increase the chance of earning them. (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive these characters!)<br>
Timed Score rewards are also available!

※Activate Cat Princess by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Activate Sleeping Princess Beauty by visiting the Super Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ Tap the Timed Score button on the collab stage map screen to view all possible score rewards.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・New Awaken stages available starting from day 5 of the collab!'''}}<br>
Starting {{Color|#FF0000|'''November 17th'''}}, take on the stages "{{Color|#0000FF|'''Princess Punt Awakens!'''}}" and "{{Color|#0000FF|'''Sleeping Beauty Punt Awakens!'''}}" to unlock {{Color|#FF00FF|'''True forms'''}} for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Princess Punt'''}} and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Sleeping Beauty Punt'''}} respectively!

※Princess Punt can be earned by logging in for 5 days during the collab event. Sleeping Beauty Punt can eb earned from collab stage "Alluring Princess."<br>
※Princess Punt and Sleeping Beauty Punt must be at Lv. 20 or above to evolve into their True Forms.<br>
※The ability to evolve Princess Punt and Sleeping Beauty Punt into their True Forms can be unlocked without earning these units.<br>
※Tap the Timed Score button on the collab stage map screen to view all possible score rewards.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Starting from the 8th day of the collab, high XP and item reward stages will be available!'''}}<br>
Starting {{Color|#FF0000|'''November 20th'''}}, take on new stages "{{Color|#3366FF|'''Teachings of the Kicking Kingdom'''}}" and "{{Color|#3366FF|'''To Battle! The Great Sweets War!'''}}"<br>
In these Timed Score stages, you will earn bigger and better rewards the higher your final score result! Clear the stage faster to earn a better score and get the best prizes!

※Tap the Timed Score button on the collab stage map screen to view all possible score rewards.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Catclaw Dojo Stage: "Princess Punt's Army"'''}}<br>
Visit the Catclaw Dojo's special collab event{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Princess Punt's Army'''}}and pit your score against a world of the Battle Cats fans as you race to the top of the leaderboards!<br>
Can you clear the stage within the time limit and rank in the top 1% of players?<br>
Clear the stage, get a high score and earn rewards based on your score tier at the end of this collab-only Dojo challenge!

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Princess Punt Sweets stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!

※These Special missions can only be completed until November 27th at 11:00am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Login daily to earn items and a limited unit!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base menu during this campaign, you will pick up another login stamp! More login stamps will get you bigger and better prizes, including {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Special unit'''}} [[Kerihime (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Princess Punt'''}}]]!

※Up to 14 Stamps can be earned during this event.

For more information of Princess Punt Sweets visit:<br>
http://kerihime.gungho.jp/kps/

