==Trivia==
*Princess Punt is the first franchise to collaborate with Battle Cats.
*Despite not being released to [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] until [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]], in the game files there are translated names for the first 2013 collaboration event.
*All of the Japanese stage names in Teachings of the Kicking Kingdom are derived from Japanese proverbs.
*Sleeping Beauty Punt is named incorrectly within the event information, being called "Sleeping Beauty Princess" while Kerihime is called "Princess Punt".

